IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ssc-core`
IMPORT `ssc8-sch4`

-- Tests for ssc8-sch4.l4 (Schedule 4). The tables are omitted from the text, so the figures below are illustrative
-- inputs, not rates.

§ `Tests for Schedule 4`

§§ `Part I -- paragraph 2`

#ASSERT `sch 4 pt I para 2 the lower rate of short-term incapacity benefit in pounds` (JUST 80.5) EQUALS JUST 80.5
#ASSERT `sch 4 pt I para 2 the lower rate of short-term incapacity benefit in pounds` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 4 pt I para 2 the higher rate of short-term incapacity benefit in pounds` (JUST 95) EQUALS JUST 95
#ASSERT `sch 4 pt I para 2 the higher rate of short-term incapacity benefit in pounds` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Part V -- paragraphs 5 and 6`

#ASSERT `sch 4 pt V para 5 the increase of the disablement pension in pounds` (JUST 12.25) EQUALS JUST 12.25
#ASSERT `sch 4 pt V para 5 the increase of the disablement pension in pounds` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 4 pt V para 6 the increase of the unemployability supplement in pounds` (JUST 40) EQUALS JUST 40
#ASSERT `sch 4 pt V para 6 the increase of the unemployability supplement in pounds` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
